---

Scope: everything in this folder, including the d3d12.dll shim, the Mac app, the
tests and the vendor reports, with one exception. The files
shader-fix/sm2fix-pool-*.dxil and shader-fix/sm2fix-skinning.dxil are modified
copies of shaders from Marvel's Spider-Man 2. Rights in those belong to the game's
owners and are not covered by this dedication. They can be rebuilt on a user's own machine
from shaders dumped out of their copy of the game (the shim's dump_compute option)
with shader-fix/make-pool-fix.sh and shader-fix/typed2raw.py, which are covered.
